# Readline rings the terminal bell (BEL) on things like backspace at an
# empty line or ambiguous tab-completion. Ghostty can't tell that apart
# from a deliberate BEL (e.g. Claude Code's completion notification), so
# every stray readline bell was triggering the same border/tab/attention
# effect. Silencing it here keeps BEL reserved for intentional signals.
set bell-style none
